WEBVTT

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:20.800
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:25.260
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:30.710
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:34.930
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:37.590
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.250
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:42.960
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:47.790
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:00:50.390 --> 00:00:53.500
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:59.250
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:12.360
Hey.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:14.870
There is an election
for the school pupil leader post.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:17.120
Did you know?
- I know.

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:20.040
I didn't ask you.
Radhi.

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:22.040
You should run for that post.

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:24.820
Why are you asking me
to do that out of the blue?

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:27.190
Then? Everything here

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:29.590
including the cultural fests,
need permission from Vikram.

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:31.330
Isn't he an SPL?

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:32.290
Correct.

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:33.960
But he has a lot of friends.

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:36.120
So, whoever becomes the SPL here

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:38.080
nothing will happen
here without asking him.

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:40.620
But if you compete, you will win.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.690
Because you are studying well.

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:44.160
You are active in sports.

00:01:44.380 --> 00:01:45.250
Why don't you go for it?

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:47.200
Get lost.
I can't do it.

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:48.580
I am not interested in all that.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:50.480
Just try it, Radhi.

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:52.870
This will be a new
experience for you.

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:56.470
And you said you wanted
to exact revenge on Vikram.

00:01:56.770 --> 00:01:58.660
If you win, we can
put an end to him.

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:01.120
That's not a reason
to run an election.

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:02.680
Being an SPL is not so easy.

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:04.410
Why is she talking like this?

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:06.210
Vikram is irritating us.

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:08.750
You are right, Radhi.

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:11.190
You don't have
to run this election.

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:12.290
Why?

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:13.870
You can't do it, Radhi.

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:15.500
Why can't I do it?

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:16.910
You can't do it.

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:21.120
You can't stand against these
guys and win the election.

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:22.460
Why can't I do it?

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:23.880
Then prove it.

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:25.040
Why should I?

00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:27.210
I don't have to prove anything
by doing this.

00:02:28.510 --> 00:02:31.370
You are irritating her when
I asked you to convince her.

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:33.540
Dude, she is scared.

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:35.120
What is there to be scared of?

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:37.160
You are scared
to take up responsibilities.

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:38.750
I am not scared of anything.

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:41.910
Guys, go to your seats.

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:45.980
Students, from this class

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:48.410
who wants to run for the SPL?

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:56.080
Why isn't anyone volunteering?

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:01.120
Radhi!

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:02.870
Radhi!

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:04.410
Tell him, Radhi.

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:09.250
She won't do it.

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:16.460
Radhi, sir!

00:03:50.650 --> 00:03:51.910
Sorry for making you wait, guys.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.120
Reena, let's start.

00:03:57.910 --> 00:03:59.480
The patient's name
is Palani, age 52.

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.230
He was admitted
because of a swollen leg.

00:04:01.270 --> 00:04:03.040
When further
investigation was done

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:05.540
we came to know that his urinary
output is low. And fatigue, too.

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:07.790
These are his initial lab reports.

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:09.470
Due to his
declining kidney function

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:11.040
we suspected renal failure.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.310
Later, when we tested his liver,
we came to know

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:15.080
that it is advanced liver cirrhosis.

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:17.660
INR, rubin, albumin,
everything is abnormal.

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:19.370
What is your diagnosis?

00:04:19.490 --> 00:04:21.220
Hepatorenal syndrome, type 1

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:25.000
Acute kidney failure
to end-stage liver disease.

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:26.290
Treatment plan?

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:29.460
Ma'am, I think it would be better
if we ask you for a suggestion.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:31.830
To whom?

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.590
To me or to Radhi?

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:36.710
Sir, they wanted to get
an opinion from both of you.

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:38.680
That's why I asked
you to come here.

00:04:39.570 --> 00:04:41.290
Sir, what is your suggestion?

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:44.970
Liver damage.

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:47.830
Liver transplant.
Find a donor, get the job done.

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:49.620
You said it so easily, Vijay.

00:04:50.530 --> 00:04:52.330
How can we do only
the liver transplantation?

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:53.910
What about the kidney failure?

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:55.930
You said acute
kidney failure, right?

00:04:55.990 --> 00:04:58.210
So, it is still
functioning somewhat.

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:00.460
What you are saying
is very wrong, Vijay.

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:03.910
If we do this treatment alone,
the patient's life is in danger.

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:05.460
There are unnecessary expenses.

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:07.540
It is going to cost Rs. 30 lakhs
for the liver transplantation.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:08.620
That is more priority now.

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:10.790
Do it first and then
do a kidney transplant.

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:13.140
But if we have to do
both at the same time..

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:14.540
You don't have to be adamant.

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:17.390
Sir, but we can only do what
is right for the patient, right?

00:05:17.470 --> 00:05:19.260
That's right, we have to do
what is right for the patient.

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:20.620
So, we can do what I said.

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:24.330
There is a financial
commitment too, right?

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:27.280
Kidney is functioning
somewhat okay.

00:05:27.350 --> 00:05:28.580
The structure is intact.

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:30.540
When the hepatic pressure
comes down, it will be fine.

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:32.000
It won't be like that here.

00:05:32.820 --> 00:05:34.580
Creatinine levels are elevated.

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:38.790
And in the last five days, the
urine levels have reduced by half.

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:42.710
And we are suspecting
secondary tubular injury.

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:45.710
As the urine level is low, it is
already affecting the kidney.

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:48.120
We can't let that happen.

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:50.000
Will you suggest
a combined transplant for that?

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:52.740
It is not going to be easy, Radhi.
- Yes, it is not easy.

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:55.540
But if we do
the liver transplant now

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:58.780
we might face an acute
kidney failure in another month.

00:05:58.870 --> 00:05:59.830
We should avoid that.

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:03.210
Reena, Teju, you follow what I say.

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:05.250
Hello, how can you
take that decision?

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:06.460
Are you the chief doctor?

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:10.200
No.
- No, right?

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:12.000
So they can follow
what I said, right, Arjun?

00:06:12.730 --> 00:06:15.330
Sir, you are the doctor here.

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:16.650
Not me.

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:19.660
You have to say what is right
for the patient and what to do.

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:22.910
Arjun, the treatment
I suggested is correct.

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:25.140
What I said is correct.
I'm not stupid.

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:27.460
Vijay, how can you be so sure?

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:30.410
This is what
all the doctors would say.

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:32.620
This is going to be an
ongoing problem, Arjun.

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:35.310
We are debating equally. But whose
decision are you going to take?

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.540
Mine or her?

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:38.830
This problem will continue
till there is a chief doctor.

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:40.660
Sir, what can I do?

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:44.460
The process to appoint the chief
doctor from my end has started.

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:49.870
And, ma'am, I had asked you
to be the chief doctor temporarily.

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:53.290
She won't accept it, Arjun.

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:55.580
I mean, the chief doctor
has a lot of responsibilities.

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:57.120
Maybe she wants to play it safe.

00:06:58.330 --> 00:06:59.830
Who is playing it safe?

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:02.130
Yeah, it looks like it.
Anyway, you need guts for that.

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:03.580
But she is not going to accept it.

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:05.420
There is no point
in waiting for her, Arjun.

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:08.370
Reena, Teju.

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:09.870
Follow what I say.

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:12.460
Hello.. How can you finalise it?

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:15.210
Because I am the temporary
chief doctor of RK Hospital.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.070
Since when?

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:26.000
From this moment onward.

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:35.870
Arjun, I will hold the post till
you appoint another chief doctor.

00:07:36.630 --> 00:07:37.540
Sure, ma'am.

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:44.710
Sure.

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:29.250
Sir, what are you doing here?

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:32.140
Um, the..

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:33.870
Do you know him?

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:36.620
I know him.

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:38.750
Do you know him?

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:42.370
No, I just met him.
That's why I asked you.

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:44.430
Oh.

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:47.040
He is Dr. Radhi's father.

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:48.660
Oh.

00:08:48.830 --> 00:08:51.540
He comes for a general
check-up now and then.

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:54.960
What happened?
Are you not feeling well?

00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:59.040
You are getting old.
Take care of your health, sir.

00:09:00.530 --> 00:09:02.160
Reena, give him
a thorough check-up.

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:05.080
Come. Grand..

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:08.080
Come on, sir.
- You go ahead, Doctor.

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:09.100
I will come.

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:31.120
I already told you, right?

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:33.960
To vacate this place.

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:35.910
I also told you, right?

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:37.710
That I will not leave this place.

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:41.620
You are happy that you got closure.

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:43.080
I didn't get it.

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:44.750
No one is worried about it.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:47.430
Everyone is happy.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:48.790
I don't get it, sir.

00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:52.160
Something happened to me.
I haven't come out of it.

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:53.660
I didn't get married.

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:56.080
But Radhi got married and moved on.

00:09:56.890 --> 00:09:58.290
That's what I don't understand.

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:02.000
Whatever happened in her life

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:03.580
happened in your life as well.

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:06.460
But she is more affected.

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:07.870
Exactly, sir.

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:10.040
That's why I need to know how.

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:11.830
That's the answer I need, old man.

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:16.620
You have a health check-up, right?
Take care of your health, sir.

00:10:21.460 --> 00:10:22.370
Is he the one?

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:24.680
Dr. Kumar.

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:25.710
What was it? Vijay.

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:26.910
Dr. Vijay.

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:28.960
Yes, Grandpa.

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:30.430
He is a good doctor.

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:32.660
But I don't think
he is a good person.

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:34.580
How do you say that?

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:37.120
He has been irritating mom
ever since he came here.

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:40.580
When he is talking,
he talks as if he knows mom.

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:44.160
How would he know her?

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.040
After he came here

00:10:48.130 --> 00:10:51.790
he might've found out her situation
and is trying to take advantage.

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:54.410
How would he know that situation?

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:57.710
He knows that situation somehow.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.040
How would I know if you ask me?

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:01.970
You, be careful with him.

00:11:02.110 --> 00:11:03.000
That's it.

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:04.580
Tell that to your daughter.

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:07.500
I will tell my daughter and
my granddaughter, okay?

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:09.120
Okay, Grandpa, give me your hand.

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:16.660
Come, Manasa.

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:19.680
Why didn't you attend
the session yesterday, Arjun?

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:21.410
You didn't even attend my call.

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:23.910
Sorry, I had some work.

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:26.960
I wanted to call and inform you.
But I forgot.

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:29.710
Were you at work?

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:31.960
Or were you with Reena?

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:34.330
I really had some work.

00:11:36.030 --> 00:11:38.080
How can you say
that I went with Reena?

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:39.710
Why should I lie to you?

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:42.290
I am just worried, Arjun.

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:45.290
You have come only
for a few counselling sessions.

00:11:45.840 --> 00:11:48.290
But I have seen
many patients like you.

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:50.120
No, Manasa.

00:11:51.450 --> 00:11:54.870
I feel that all our counselling
sessions are about Reena.

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:59.250
All our sessions have
only been about Reena.

00:11:59.350 --> 00:12:03.080
Arjun..
- Because she is my trigger point.

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:07.500
But I have had this issue
even before I met her.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:10.290
Which I've mentioned before.
- That is correct, Arjun.

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:11.330
I agree with you.

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:12.580
And..
- Not just that.

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:13.640
Somewhere..

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:16.830
I think you are thinking
this from the wrong angle. - Oh!

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:21.080
So, have you become
an expert in this matter, Arjun?

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:22.830
I didn't mean that.

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:27.160
It's okay.

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:32.500
You do whatever you feel like.

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:35.960
You can go the way
you are going now.

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:38.580
If it works, that's fine.

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:39.920
Well.

00:12:40.060 --> 00:12:41.520
If this doesn't work..

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:45.250
No, why should I be negative?

00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:46.720
Okay.

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:50.900
Observe your emotions
from now on, let's see.

00:13:05.170 --> 00:13:06.500
Guna.
- Tell me.

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:08.500
I want your house.

00:13:08.690 --> 00:13:09.570
Why?

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:11.930
That is, Charu and I..

00:13:13.240 --> 00:13:15.910
You and Charu?
- Let me finish.

00:13:16.130 --> 00:13:17.970
It's not just Charu and me..

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:19.490
Then?

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:23.160
Reena, Nilofer, Kiran, all of them.

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:24.460
Is it a party?

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:26.790
I can't call it a party.

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:29.210
If you and Anitha have any problems

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:30.580
we help you, right?

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:33.790
You are the reason why
Anitha and I are facing problems.

00:13:34.470 --> 00:13:37.660
Hey, nothing has happened
till now since you tried.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:38.870
Try to understand.
- Hey.

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:41.100
Won't you help me
by giving your house key?

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:43.190
No.
The last time you came over

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:45.000
you tortured me
by asking me to wear her vest.

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:46.750
I didn't like it.

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:48.330
No one should come to my house.

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:49.600
Hey!

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:51.040
There is no alcohol this time.

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:52.750
No drinking.
- Hey.

00:13:52.900 --> 00:13:54.160
This is what I am scared of.

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:56.540
You're capable of many things
even when you're sober.

00:13:57.290 --> 00:13:59.460
Buddy! Rocky is a good boy.

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:01.460
Hey, listen to me.

00:14:01.710 --> 00:14:02.790
Charu and I have a problem.

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:04.870
If you help us get back together

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:07.000
I will happily marry
Charu and settle down.

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:08.750
Hey, Ramakrishna!

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:10.830
Why do you want to get married?

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:13.910
Hey! Why are you all
asking me the same question?

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.160
Why shouldn't I get married?

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:17.870
You shouldn't.
I can't convince Anitha.

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:20.460
She has been glaring at everyone.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.830
Guna, it's time for the rounds,
let's go. - Hi.

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:26.040
Buddy, ask her, she will agree.

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:31.540
Senior!
- What's wrong with you?

00:14:31.910 --> 00:14:35.290
Senior, shall I bring Charu
over to your house?

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:37.830
Hey, what do you
think my house is?

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:39.380
No.

00:14:39.430 --> 00:14:41.540
What were you two
thinking about it?

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:42.710
Rocky.

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:43.870
No, senior.

00:14:43.990 --> 00:14:45.460
I just told him in detail.

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:47.020
Ask him and find out.

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:49.750
Just say yes.
- I can't do that.

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:51.960
When you come to my house,
you jump on the bed.

00:14:52.300 --> 00:14:53.750
You even question
the hair on the floor.

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:56.210
I won't allow it.
You overdo everything.

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:58.040
Senior, I swear.

00:14:58.280 --> 00:15:00.210
I won't see anything
other than Charu.

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:01.820
Please, senior.

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.960
Just like how you got Ravi married

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:08.020
help me get married to Charu
and brighten my life.

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:09.370
Marriage?
- Yes.

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:12.350
Hey, Ramakrishna.

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:13.460
Why do you..
- Senior!

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:16.910
Will I get the house key or not?

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:20.680
Okay, take it.

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:23.160
Hey, don't do it, listen to me.

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:26.410
Hey!
- No, Rocky is our guy.

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:29.000
Let it be.
- Thank you, senior.

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:30.040
Okay.

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:31.910
Come on.
It's time for the rounds.

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:33.500
Yes, go on, it's time.

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:35.040
I don't understand.

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:37.830
Just for fun.

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:41.400
Come.

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:52.040
Arjun, give me the water.
- No, Reena.

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:53.410
I took a direct sip.

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:55.330
I'll get you another one.
- No, it's okay.

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:02.330
What happened?

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:05.160
This is water.
- Yes.

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:07.540
But you left behind
a bottle yesterday, right?

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:08.870
What was in it?

00:16:09.920 --> 00:16:10.830
That was..

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:12.160
Soft drink.

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:13.250
It was a soft drink.

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:15.160
What was mixed in it?

00:16:17.630 --> 00:16:19.080
You're drinking while at work.

00:16:19.730 --> 00:16:21.830
How long has this been
going on, Arjun? - Reena..

00:16:22.630 --> 00:16:23.500
Please.

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:24.910
Can you please come with me?

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:27.370
Speak softly.

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:28.370
Please.

00:16:29.570 --> 00:16:30.500
That was alcohol.

00:16:30.890 --> 00:16:31.830
I lied to you.

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:34.910
But I am getting better.

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:36.210
I saw that.

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:38.290
Thank God you are not a doctor.

00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:41.210
But you are in an important
position in the hospital, Arjun.

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:43.210
You tell me if what
you are doing is right.

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:45.500
It's wrong.

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:48.440
But I am trying to quit.

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:50.120
Okay, what steps have you taken?

00:16:51.790 --> 00:16:52.690
I..

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:56.940
I am taking counselling
sessions from Manasa.

00:16:57.680 --> 00:17:00.710
So far, I have attended a few
sessions and she is helping me.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:02.370
You can ask her.

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:03.650
Arjun.

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:05.830
If you go too far

00:17:06.560 --> 00:17:08.870
you won't be able
to come out of this.

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:10.370
I know, Reena.

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:11.870
Trust me.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:14.210
I am taking all necessary
measures to come out of it.

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:16.370
Don't worry about it.

00:17:17.690 --> 00:17:18.540
Okay.

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:20.540
So, from now on..

00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:22.250
When you go to Manasa's sessions

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:24.460
you have to tell me how it went.

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:27.000
I want to know
what level you're on.

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:29.870
Okay.

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:32.280
But..

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:34.250
Don't tell anyone else.

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:36.250
Please.

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:37.810
Okay.

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.980
Hi, dude!
- Tilak!

00:17:44.840 --> 00:17:48.540
I came running to see you when
I got to know you are in Chennai.

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:50.210
How are you?
- I am doing great.

00:17:50.240 --> 00:17:51.340
Great, that's okay.

00:17:51.470 --> 00:17:53.090
You didn't tell me that
you are in Chennai.

00:17:53.240 --> 00:17:54.710
That's a long story,
I will tell you later.

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:57.210
First, guess with whom
I am working here.

00:17:57.520 --> 00:17:59.370
With whom?
- With Radhi.

00:17:59.860 --> 00:18:01.330
Radhi from school?
- Yes.

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:02.870
What are you saying?

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:05.400
Has she become a doctor?
- Unreal, right?

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:08.080
I thought the same.
She is working here.

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:09.750
It's been many
years since I saw her.

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:11.160
Ask her to come, let's meet her.

00:18:11.850 --> 00:18:13.250
She won't come here.
She is the chief doctor.

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:15.500
We have to go and meet her.
- Chief doctor?

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:17.750
What are you saying?

00:18:18.210 --> 00:18:19.910
Okay, let's go and surprise her.

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:21.080
Let's go.

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:23.460
Radhi.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.540
An important person
has come to meet you.

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:27.660
Who is it?

00:18:28.320 --> 00:18:30.130
Ta-da!

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:31.710
Hi.

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:35.040
Don't you recognise me?

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:37.040
What is this?

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:40.000
Think about it.

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:41.710
To exact revenge on Vikram

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:46.290
you'd break his bicycle
into pieces and give it to him.

00:18:46.420 --> 00:18:49.010
During recess,
we used to enjoy 'Egg Puffs'.

00:18:49.090 --> 00:18:50.190
Tilak!

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:54.290
It's been so long!
How are you?

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:55.750
I'm good.
- Sit.

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:56.960
It's okay.

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:59.620
Do you know Vikram's story?
- What?

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:02.250
We fought like enemies
during school days,

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:04.660
but we became
very close after that.

00:19:05.980 --> 00:19:08.290
Did you know that he even
invited me to his wedding?

00:19:08.570 --> 00:19:10.330
Oh, are you in touch with him?

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:12.870
Yes, we meet and talk often.

00:19:13.870 --> 00:19:16.870
You broke his bicycle, right?

00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:18.210
I told him about it.

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:19.330
What did he say?

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:21.290
He already knew about it.

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:22.500
Oh!

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:26.500
I heard
that you've become a doctor.

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:31.120
You used to be scared
of the SPL selection in school.

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:33.280
Now, you have
become the chief doctor.

00:19:33.370 --> 00:19:35.620
But I became the SPL
even back then, right?

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:39.750
Can anyone stand against Radhi?
- Yes.

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:42.910
If we don't follow orders,
she punishes us.

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:44.120
Punishment?

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:48.410
Back in school, you used to get
punished along with us.

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:50.370
Now, you are punishing others.

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:52.620
Ask her what punishment it is.
- What is the punishment?

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:55.290
Fifty squats.

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:11.550
Radhi.

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:15.080
I didn't expect
this change from you.

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:17.160
One minute.

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:20.660
Office call.

00:20:22.190 --> 00:20:25.300
Let's meet when we are free.
- Yes, carry on, I'll call you later.

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:26.870
Okay..

00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:29.160
Okay, see you.
- Let's meet later.

00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:30.830
Let's see.
- Okay.

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:32.160
See you later.

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:35.250
It's been a long time
since I laughed like this.

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:40.020
Whenever I think of the past

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:42.330
only bitter memories come to mind.

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:45.240
But only after meeting Tilak

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:47.160
I realise that there were
so many sweet memories.

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:49.710
Having been through all that..

00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:55.540
How did you manage to get married
and have kids, leading a happy life?

00:20:56.370 --> 00:20:57.580
And it's a love marriage.

00:20:58.370 --> 00:21:00.040
I can't get over it, Radhi.

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:02.900
Everyone has to get
over it at some point, Vijay.

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:04.870
Look for a life partner.

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:09.000
After she comes into your life,
you can get over it, too.

00:21:09.750 --> 00:21:10.790
How, Radhi?

00:21:13.180 --> 00:21:14.160
I don't know, Vijay.

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.040
I got over it.

00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:19.620
Our love story is over.

00:21:20.010 --> 00:21:23.330
Instead of still talking about it,
you should move on.

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:27.120
You forgot our love.

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:31.370
But our child?

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:35.500
Our child died.

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:39.370
How did it not
affect you as a mother?

00:21:44.580 --> 00:21:45.750
Our child died?

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:49.580
Your father told me
that our child had died.

00:21:52.770 --> 00:21:54.690
D-Did my father tell you that?

00:21:56.610 --> 00:21:57.750
How did you get over it?

00:22:00.930 --> 00:22:03.540
I still can't get over it.

00:22:08.310 --> 00:22:10.580
'After so many years,
Vijay and I met each other.'

00:22:11.250 --> 00:22:12.460
'He asked about me.'

00:22:12.820 --> 00:22:14.660
'He asked about my marriage.'

00:22:15.340 --> 00:22:17.580
'But.. Till now..'

00:22:18.130 --> 00:22:20.830
'He didn't mention
anything about our child..'

00:22:23.090 --> 00:22:24.580
'He didn't ask about Reena.'

00:22:29.450 --> 00:22:31.370
Don't ask me anything, Vijay.
I have to leave.

